<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We want your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, so I’m sorry to hear about your concerns regarding announcements on departure from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Airport announcements</strong><br />
<br />
We understand how important clear and timely communication is while making your way through the terminal and apologise for any <em><strong>&lt;confusion/delays&gt; </strong></em>this might have caused you.<br />
<br />
Customer feedback told us that we were making too many announcements in the lounge, so we reduced the number of boarding calls to just one first and final call for each flight.<br />
<br />
Boarding times are printed on each customer’s boarding pass and displayed on departure boards throughout the terminal and our lounges, which helps customers to plan their walk to the gate in time for boarding commencement.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the Airport Management in {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} so we can work to improve this aspect of our service in future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting us and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>